00:11:29.670 --> 00:11:31.670
But if you want to sponsor us.

255
00:11:31.670 --> 00:11:35.930
But we are available because we are enthusiastic about these episodes.

256
00:11:36.310 --> 00:11:36.510
Exactly.

257
00:11:36.750 --> 00:11:37.050
Exactly.

258
00:11:37.930 --> 00:11:38.850
Give us a call.

259
00:11:39.070 --> 00:11:39.310
Yeah.

260
00:11:39.530 --> 00:11:40.230
Ringy dingy.

261
00:11:40.690 --> 00:11:41.210
All right.

262
00:11:41.350 --> 00:11:42.870
Well, let's go into this mailbag.

263
00:11:43.050 --> 00:11:46.330
I have, oh my gosh, this one really cracked me up, lady.

264
00:11:46.430 --> 00:11:47.010
