265
00:11:47.130 --> 00:11:47.270
Okay.

266
00:11:47.590 --> 00:11:47.830
Okay.

267
00:11:48.010 --> 00:11:49.330
This is from Shannon B.

268
00:11:49.510 --> 00:11:50.230
in Virginia.

269
00:11:50.890 --> 00:11:52.310
Shannon says, quote,

270
00:11:52.590 --> 00:11:56.130
My husband and I were invited to another couple's house for dinner.

271
00:11:56.450 --> 00:11:59.530
They served chicken legs with no sides.

272
00:11:59.530 --> 00:12:06.230
Then proceeded to get drunk while the husband accused the wife of having a crush on her co-worker.

273
00:12:06.630 --> 00:12:11.810
As if things weren't awkward enough, they decided to call the co-worker in question

274
00:12:11.810 --> 00:12:16.070
